  "Name": "Advanced Rock Paper Scissors",
  "Overview": "Advanced Rock Paper Scissors is based on the game of rock, paper, scissors, but it replaces the traditional hand gestures with the elements wood, water and fire, that now appear on cards.\n\nAt the beginning of each round both players are dealt cards representing each element with numbers on them. If the player wins a round, they score the points on the front of the card. The player with the most points at the end of the game wins.\n\nAdvanced Rock Paper Scissors can also be played between two human players on the same console.",
